## Usage

### Run comparison
:::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="TemplateExperimentsDemo" code-lang="vue" description="Once in view, r6 trains on from step 1,200 to the end in about 6 seconds; stop it, tick the runs to compare, or switch the metric at any time."}
